+## Fyodor compatibility fixes (2026-11-15)
+
+Opt-out canvases retain their own Tab editing commands; positive tab orders
+still opt a canvas into form traversal. SDL's existing custom file chooser
+and message box now register explicit stops, focus an initial control and
+dispatch Tab/Shift+Tab plus focused button activation in their modal loops.
+Hidden location fields have order zero. No control-kind classifications change.
+Fyodor's integration tests exercise document Tab and form traversal; these
+consumer-carried fixes do not establish new cross-platform runtime coverage.
+
+SDL's existing custom buttons accept Space/Enter and checkboxes accept Space
+from focused physical-key dispatch. SDL message text uses multiline drawing.
